 pipeline full"], [2.658725, "reasoning", "; if wrong"], [2.680237, "reasoning", ", throw"], [2.702237, "reasoning", " out"], [2.72366, "reasoning", " and restart"], [2.745385, "reasoning", ", like taking"], [2.766815, "reasoning", " wrong"], [2.788254, "reasoning", " turn on"], [2.809786, "reasoning", " assembly"], [2.831324, "reasoning", " line. Cache"], [2.852686, "reasoning", ": memory is slow"], [2.874138, "reasoning", ", cache"], [2.89546, "reasoning", " near"], [2.916891, "reasoning", " CPU"], [2.93816, "reasoning", " holds recent"], [2.959546, "reasoning", " stuff; levels"], [2.98106, "reasoning", "; program"], [3.002689, "reasoning", " locality"], [3.024072, "reasoning", ". Maybe also"], [3.04607, "reasoning", " mention"], [3.067166, "reasoning", " that modern"], [3.088976, "reasoning", " CPUs do"], [3.110312, "reasoning", " all"], [3.131915, "reasoning", " this"], [3.153619, "reasoning", " in"], [3.17509, "reasoning", " parallel"], [3.196387, "reasoning", " and automatically"], [3.217657, "reasoning", ". End"], [3.239268, "reasoning", " with summary"], [3.260949, "reasoning", ": program"], [3.282565, "reasoning", " becomes"], [3.303724, "reasoning", " a stream"], [3.325297, "reasoning", ","], [3.346831, "reasoning", " CPU keeps"], [3.368476, "reasoning", " it flowing"], [3.389806, "reasoning", " by"], [3.411397, "reasoning", " predicting"], [3.432861, "reasoning", " and"], [3.454512, "reasoning", " re"], [3.476167, "reasoning", "ordering and"], [3.497689, "reasoning", " ho"], [3.51897, "reasoning", "arding data"], [3.540484, "reasoning", ". Ensure"], [3.562268, "reasoning", " high"], [3.583755, "reasoning", " school curiosity"], [3.605396, "reasoning", ". Use"], [3.626783, "reasoning", " fun"], [3.648317, "reasoning", " language"], [3.6699, "reasoning", ". Final answer only.\n"], [3.66999, "content", "\n\n"], [3.691432, "content", "Imagine a CPU as an"], [3.712964, "content", " **"], [3.734273, "content", "ext"], [3.755912, "content", "remely fast, tiny"], [3.777207, "content", " restaurant kitchen** that gets"], [3.798976, "content", " a"], [3.820272, "content", " recipe one"], [3.841954, "content", " step"], [3.86349, "content", " at a time.\n\nYou write"], [3.881849, "content", " a program."], [3.900742, "content", " The CPU"], [3.919511, "content", " has to"], [3.938578, "content", " turn"], [3.957554, "content", " those instructions"], [3.97664, "content", " into actions"], [3.995658, "content", " billions"], [4.014645, "content", " of times per second. But the CPU"], [4.033479, "content", "’s"], [4.052506, "content", " “"], [4.071526, "content", "brain” is not magical"], [4.091, "content", ":"], [4.10952, "content", " it uses clever"], [4.128614, "content", " tricks to stay"], [4.147691, "content", " busy"], [4.166566, "content", " almost"], [4.18543, "content", " all the time.\n\n## 1"], [4.204296, "content", ". Programs"], [4.223354, "content", " are just"], [4.242076, "content", " lists of instructions\n\nA program is a"], [4.261028, "content", " list of tiny commands"], [4.279881, "content", " like"], [4.299079, "content", ":\n\n- Fetch this"], [4.317823, "content", " number."], [4.336524, "content", "\n- Add two"], [4.355384, "content", " numbers.\n- Compare"], [4.374272, "content", " them"], [4.393096, "content", ".\n- If one"], [4.411989, "content", " is bigger, do"], [4.431047, "content", " something.\n- Store the result."], [4.449988, "content", "\n\nThe CPU reads these from"], [4.468971, "content", " memory, but not"], [4.487779, "content", " all at once. It takes"], [4.50649, "content", " them in"], [4.525689, "content", " one"], [4.544638, "content", " by"], [4.563542, "content", " one, super"], [4.582465, "content", " fast.\n\n## 2. Pip"], [4.601539, "content", "el"], [4.620424, "content", "ining: the assembly-line"], [4.639224, "content", " trick\n\nIf"], [4.658348, "content", " the"], [4.677083, "content", " CPU did one full"], [4.696217, "content", " instruction from"], [4.714978, "content", " start to finish before"], [4.734128, "content", " starting the next, it would be slow"], [4.753166, "content", ".\n\nInstead, it"], [4.772021, "content", " uses a **pipeline"], [4.791008, "content", "**."], [4.809899, "content", "\n\nThink of it like a car"], [4.829056, "content", " factory"], [4.847825, "content", ":\n\n1. Fetch"], [4.866752, "content", " the instruction"], [4.885699, "content", "  \n"], [4.904816, "content", "2. Decode what"], [4.923623, "content", " it means  \n3. Figure"], [4.942618, "content", " out"], [4.961308, "content", " which parts"], [4.980133, "content", " to use  \n4. Execute it"], [4.99913, "content", "  \n5. Store the result\n\nA"], [5.018052, "content", " single"], [5.036901, "content", " instruction passes"], [5.055862, "content", " through these"], [5.074738, "content", " stages. But multiple instructions can"], [5.09401, "content", " be in different stages at"], [5.113003, "content", " the same time.\n\nExample:\n\n"], [5.13212, "content", "```"], [5.151092, "content", "text\nTime"], [5.170183, "content", " 1"], [5.18882, "content", ":  Instruction"], [5.207871, "content", " A is in stage 1"], [5.226712, "content", "\nTime 2:  A"], [5.245942, "content", " is in stage 2, B is"], [5.26475, "content", " in stage 1\nTime 3"], [5.283661, "content", ":  A is in stage 3"], [5.302778, "content", ", B is in stage 2,"], [5.321579, "content", " C is in stage 1\n```"], [5.340259, "content", "\n\nSo the CPU is not waiting"], [5.359326, "content", " for one"], [5.378238, "content", " instruction to finish completely"], [5.397167, "content", ". It’s"], [5.416144, "content", " keeping the whole"], [5.435013, "content", " pipeline"], [5.454053, "content", " full.\n\nThis is why CPUs"], [5.472954, "content", " can execute"], [5.491839, "content", " many"], [5.510682, "content", " instructions per"], [5.529877, "content", " second even though"], [5.548709, "content", " each one"], [5.567622, "content", " has to"], [5.586594, "content", " go through several steps"], [5.605778, "content", ".\n\n## 3. Out-of"], [5.624555, "content", "-order execution: doing"], [5.643727, "content", " easy"], [5.662544, "content", " stuff first\n\nNow"], [5.681427, "content", " imagine the kitchen"], [5.700598, "content", " has"], [5.719426, "content", " several"], [5.738504, "content", " chefs.\n\nSup"], [5.757328, "content", "pose the"], [5.776349, "content", " order is:\n\n1. Make"], [5.795222, "content", " soup"], [5.814415, "content", "."], [5.833147, "content", "\n2. Fry"], [5.852066, "content", " the fish"], [5.871009, "content", ".\n3. Plate the dish."], [5.890168, "content", "\n\nBut making"], [5.909059, "content", " the soup takes"], [5.928133, "content", " 1"], [5.947023, "content", "0 minutes, while frying the fish takes"], [5.96601, "content", " 1"], [5.985377, "content", " minute.\n\n"], [6.003965, "content", "A smart kitchen"], [6.023051, "content", " does not wait around"], [6.041896, "content", "."], [6.060864, "content", " It can fry"], [6.07962, "content", " the fish while the"], [6.098758, "content", " soup is still cooking"], [6.117538, "content", ","], [6.136296, "content", " as long as the final"], [6.155266, "content", " dish is"], [6.174213, "content", " assembled correctly.\n\nCP"], [6.193068, "content", "Us do something"], [6.211969, "content", " similar. They"], [6.230975, "content", " can execute"], [6.250181, "content", " parts"], [6.269021, "content", " of a"], [6.288123, "content", " program **out"], [6.306895, "content", " of order**."], [6.325966, "content", "\n\nIf"], [6.345068, "content", " instruction"], [6.364055, "content", " "], [6.383037, "content", "5"], [6.402049, "content", " is easy"], [6.421044, "content", " and"], [6.439911, "content", " does not depend on"], [6.458899, "content", " instruction 2"], [6.477911, "content", ", the CPU can run"], [6.496865, "content", " instruction 5 while waiting"], [6.515943, "content", " for instruction 2.\n\nBut the"], [6.534916, "content", " final answer must still come"], [6.553577, "content", " out in the right"], [6.572608, "content", " order. The CPU keeps"], [6.591494, "content", " track of what must"], [6.610543, "content", " finish before"], [6.629451, "content", " what, using"], [6.648419, "content", " something"], [6.667305, "content", " called a “"], [6.686365, "content", "scoreboard” of"], [6.705267, "content", " dependencies.\n\nThis is called"], [6.724187, "content", " **out-of-order execution**.\n\nIt"], [6.74305, "content", " helps the CPU avoid"], [6.761939, "content", " idle"], [6.78094, "content", " time.\n\n## 4. Branch"], [6.799847, "content", " prediction: guessing the future"], [6.819068, "content", "\n\nProgram"], [6.838078, "content", "s often have choices"], [6.856804, "content", ":\n\n```c"], [6.875523, "content", "\nif (x"], [6.894516, "content", " > 10) {\n   "], [6.91356, "content", " do A\n"], [6.93232, "content", "} else {\n    do B\n"], [6.951045, "content", "}\n```\n\nThe CPU must decide"], [6.970065, "content", ":"], [6.988951, "content", " “"], [7.007788, "content", "Which"], [7.02651, "content", " path will happen"], [7.04554, "content", "?”\n\nBut that"], [7.064537, "content", " decision sometimes"], [7.083665, "content", " depends"], [7.102728, "content", " on data"], [7.121621, "content", " that has not arrived"], [7.140604, "content", " yet.\n\nSo"], [7.159639, "content", " the"], [7.178681, "content", " CPU makes a **guess"], [7.200256, "content", "**.\n\nThis"], [7.219269, "content", " is **"], [7.238621, "content", "branch prediction**.\n\nImagine driving"], [7.257347, "content", " through a town"], [7.276406, "content", "."], [7.295325, "content", " You often expect"], [7.314326, "content", " to"], [7.333048, "content", " keep"], [7.352051, "content", " going"], [7.37121, "content", " straight at an"], [7.389945, "content", " intersection. If"], [7.409048, "content", " you almost"], [7.427699, "content", " always go"], [7.446727, "content", " straight, your brain predicts"], [7.465546, "content", " that."], [7.484584, "content", " But if you"], [7.503459, "content", " suddenly turn left, you have to slow"], [7.522348, "content", " down,"], [7.541184, "content", " stop"], [7.560132, "content", ", and reorient"], [7.578849, "content", ".\n\nThe CPU works"], [7.59798, "content", " the"], [7.616878, "content", " same way.\n\n"], [7.63567, "content", "If it predicts the"], [7.654818, "content", " program"], [7.673593, "content", " will"], [7.692493, "content", " go one"], [7.711274, "content", " way, it keeps the"], [7.730275, "content", " pipeline busy with"], [7.749362, "content", " instructions from"], [7.768062, "content", " that path. If"], [7.787009, "content", " it guesses"], [7.805735, "content", " correctly, great"], [7.824582, "content", ":"], [7.843424, "content", " the pipeline stays"], [7.862374, "content", " full"], [7.881746, "content", ".\n\nIf it guesses"], [7.900357, "content", " wrong, it has"], [7.919286, "content", " to throw"], [7.937923, "content", " away the work"], [7.956658, "content", " it already"], [7.97562, "content", " did and start"], [7.994452, "content", " again"], [8.013494, "content", " with"], [8.032371, "content", " the correct path.\n\nThat is called"], [8.051116, "content", " a **pipeline"], [8.069981, "content", " flush"], [8.0889, "content", "**,"], [8.108085, "content", " and it can cost"], [8.126837, "content", " the CPU several"], [8.145631, "content", " cycles.\n\nModern CPUs are very"], [8.164686, "content", " good at guessing"], [8.183557, "content", " because"], [8.202425, "content", " programs"], [8.221357, "content", " often repeat patterns. For example, loops"], [8.240323, "content", " usually continue"], [8.259472, "content", " many"], [8.278376, "content", " times, so"], [8.297392, "content", " the CPU can predict “"], [8.316278, "content", "keep looping"], [8.335437, "content", "”"], [8.354363, "content", " until it"], [8.373365, "content", " is"], [8.392354, "content", " told otherwise"], [8.411298, "content", ".\n\n## 5. Caches"], [8.429988, "content", ": the"], [8.449204, "content", " CPU"], [8.468273, "content", "’s memory shortcuts"], [8.487183, "content", "\n\nMemory is where"], [8.506076, "content", " programs"], [8.524945, "content", " and data live."], [8.544257, "content", " But memory is much"], [8.562813, "content", " slower than the CPU."], [8.581679, "content", "\n\nIf"], [8.600588, "content", " the CPU had"], [8.619631, "content", " to wait for main"], [8.638807, "content", " memory every time, it would spend"], [8.65734, "content", " most of its time doing"], [8.676298, "content", " nothing.\n\nSo"], [8.695481, "content", " CPUs"], [8.714423, "content", " use **caches**:"], [8.733207, "content", " tiny, very"], [8.75204, "content", " fast memory right"], [8.77098, "content", " inside or"], [8.78992, "content", " next to the CPU.\n\nThink of"], [8.808701, "content", " it like this:\n\n- Main"], [8.827834, "content", " memory is a huge warehouse"], [8.84666, "content", " far away."], [8.865427, "content", "\n- The cache"], [8.884168, "content", " is a backpack or"], [8.903177, "content", " drawer right"], [8.922199, "content", " next to you"], [8.94121, "content", ".\n\n"], [8.960114, "content", "You do"], [8.979382, "content", " not want to run"], [8.998237, "content", " to the warehouse for"], [9.017119, "content", " every pencil"], [9.036133, "content", ". You keep"], [9.055219, "content", " the most useful"], [9.074019, "content", " pencils"], [9.092879, "content", " in your drawer"], [9.111939, "content", ".\n\nCPU caches"], [9.130667, "content", " store"], [9.14965, "content", ":"], [9.168353, "content", "\n\n- recently"], [9.18722, "content", " used instructions\n- recently"], [9.206157, "content", " used data\n- things likely"], [9.224984, "content", " to be used again soon"], [9.24397, "content", "\n\nThere"], [9.262875, "content", " are several levels:\n\n-"], [9.281567, "content", " **L1 cache**: tiny, fastest"], [9.300587, "content", ", very close to the CPU."], [9.319522, "content", "\n- **L2 cache**: a"], [9.338428, "content", " bit bigger, slightly"], [9.357334, "content", " slower.\n- **L3 cache"], [9.376007, "content", "**: bigger"], [9.394994, "content", ", shared"], [9.413874, "content", " by"], [9.432651, "content", " multiple"], [9.45144, "content", " cores in"], [9.470564, "content", " some CPUs"], [9.489492, "content", ".\n\nIf the"], [9.50866, "content", " CPU needs data"], [9.527643, "content", " and it is"], [9.546472, "content", " in the cache, that"], [9.565491, "content", "’s"], [9.584471, "content", " a **cache hit**. Fast"], [9.603387, "content", ".\n\nIf it is not"], [9.622406, "content", " in the cache, that"], [9.641287, "content", "’s a **cache miss**. The"], [9.660394, "content", " CPU has to go"], [9.679407, "content", " get"], [9.698125, "content", " it from"], [9.717206, "content", " slower memory.\n\n"], [9.735916, "content", "Programs are"], [9.754853, "content", " designed"], [9.774106, "content", " to"], [9.792678, "content", " make"], [9.811833, "content", " caches useful"], [9.830565, "content", " because most"], [9.849783, "content", " programs"], [9.868375, "content", " reuse data"], [9.887279, "content", " in predictable"], [9.906185, "content", " ways"], [9.925036, "content", "."], [9.943967, "content", " For example, if you look"], [9.963031, "content", " at one"], [9.982069, "content", " item in a list, the"], [10.000912, "content", " CPU often"], [10.019841, "content", " keeps"], [10.038825, "content", " nearby items in"], [10.057525, "content", " cache too,"], [10.076448, "content", " because programs"], [10.095331, "content", " often access"], [10.114138, "content", " memory"], [10.133172, "content", " in order.\n\n## Putting"], [10.151921, "content", " it all together\n\nA modern"], [10.170731, "content", " CPU core"], [10.18948, "content", " is"], [10.208506, "content", " like a super-"], [10.227492, "content", "optimized factory"], [10.246375, "content", ":"], [10.265371, "content", "\n\n1. It"], [10.284611, "content", " pulls"], [10.303316, "content", " instructions from memory.\n2. It"], [10.322367, "content", " keeps many"], [10.341114, "content", " of"], [10.360312, "content", " them moving"], [10.379256, "content", " through a"], [10.398247, "content", " pipeline.\n3. It runs"], [10.417001, "content", " independent"], [10.435968, "content", " instructions"], [10.454908, "content", " out of order to"], [10.473733, "content", " stay busy.\n4. It guesses"], [10.492828, "content", " which"], [10.511726, "content", " branch"], [10.530839, "content", " the program will take so"], [10.54971, "content", " the pipeline does"], [10.568553, "content", " not stall.\n5. It keeps"], [10.587466, "content", " frequently used instructions"], [10.606461, "content", " and data in fast caches."], [10.625306, "content", "\n\nThe"], [10.644397, "content", " goal"], [10.662868, "content", " is simple"], [10.681897, "content", ":\n\n**Never let"], [10.700742, "content", " the CPU sit"], [10.720074, "content", " idle.**\n\nSo"], [10.7386, "content", " when you run a game"], [10.757595, "content", " or a program,"], [10.776334, "content", " the CPU is not just “"], [10.795291, "content", "reading the"], [10.814202, "content", " code"], [10.833181, "content", " slowly"], [10.852221, "content", ".” It is constantly predicting, re"], [10.871139, "content", "ordering, caching"], [10.889983, "content", ", and streaming"], [10.908952, "content", " instructions through"], [10.928335, "content", " tiny"], [10.947109, "content", " pipelines to finish"], [10.9664, "content", " your program as"], [10.985458, "content", " fast as possible."]], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 90, "total_tokens": 1800, "completion_tokens": 1710, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "reasoning_tokens": 421}, "finish": "stop", "ttft_s": 0.059504, "t_last_s": 10.985458, "t_end_s": 10.98582980001811, "completion_tokens": 1710, "decode_tok_s": 156.41654724154